first emerged.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Mysterious explosions reported in Frankfurt</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7721ca67b250c8f7022d793cf8f2806ca067191a6c9fb07b8a04709e1558b778</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T08:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-mysterious-explosions-reported-in-frankfurt/live-79300494--1397711c1e30.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-mysterious-explosions-reported-in-frankfurt/live-79300494?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A cafe and kiosk were damaged overnight in Frankfurt, in what police said are the latest in a series of mysterious blasts in the area. Meanwhile, diesel prices in Germany have hit an all-time high. More on DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Oktoberfest beer prices rise, outpacing inflation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7173a22477b368527ddf6b1425f35cb7168262d92a602542e3b01da63594353d</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T18:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-oktoberfest-beer-prices-rise-outpacing-inflation/a-79296932--12fa98bb1113.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-oktoberfest-beer-prices-rise-outpacing-inflation/a-79296932?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Oktoberfest's traditional beer mug, the Mass, will cost an average of €15.61 ($18.50) at this year's festival in Munich.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Conservative state premiers rally behind Merz</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7c4314d46bf8ee93b5ce4d63c127d476d93f7b7b336df29d30e2953c5ec4394e</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T11:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-conservative-state-premiers-rally-behind-merz/live-79289786--e3b9d59d079d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-conservative-state-premiers-rally-behind-merz/live-79289786?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">All eight CDU state premiers have backed Friedrich Merz, urging the party to focus on rebuilding trust. Plus, Germany's coalition is weighing rapid relief as record fuel prices pile pressure on households.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Klopp wants Germany's football team to 'reclaim the flag'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:01fcd06d2c7bacd3caa1fc6dac2419bf99553362ea363cd9bac7376d07189e35</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T11:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/klopp-wants-germany-s-football-team-to-reclaim-the-flag/a-79307610--57ff88db5991.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/klopp-wants-germany-s-football-team-to-reclaim-the-flag/a-79307610?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Jürgen Klopp, Germany's new head coach, says he wants his team to reclaim pride in being German after recent political developments.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Jews once lived lived here: When houses tell stories</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:52bf65bf0c0cfc2e77f55bc84fab6c671c6ead2170d480419fa2cca8ca305336</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T09:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/jews-once-lived-lived-here-when-houses-tell-stories/a-79264813--f29d1ad1c32d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/jews-once-lived-lived-here-when-houses-tell-stories/a-79264813?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Time and again, residents tracing the history of their homes discover the lives of Jewish predecessors who fled or were deported amid stories of suffering and loss.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Jürgen Klopp's first Germany squad includes 44 players</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cfd2a388d65480cb39cee78f935055c0f49d839ddd897804b4eea931259d804a</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T08:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/j_rgen-klopp-s-first-germany-squad-includes-44-players/a-79289254--9874c23792d0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/jürgen-klopp-s-first-germany-squad-includes-44-players/a-79289254?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's new head coach Jürgen Klopp has named a huge squad for his first four games, splitting them into two groups. A host of new faces is included.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Chancellor Merz seeks CDU support amid far-right AfD surge</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:682bd89c9f4b808c432f4d712c00dd634aadddf2c125c8623090b067334786d5</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T16:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/chancellor-merz-seeks-cdu-support-amid-far-right-afd-surge/a-79290192--a35bb5a14b7a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/chancellor-merz-seeks-cdu-support-amid-far-right-afd-surge/a-79290192?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Following the CDU's crushing defeat in the Saxony-Anhalt state election, many are expressing doubts about the party's leader, Chancellor Friedrich Merz. But the CDU doesn't appear to have a viable alternative.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>After Neuer: Who will be Germany's new No. 1 goalkeeper?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cdceb39828c2cb4a3025cf3ceb2e2241a97e77fe3e58611e36a3af7f1b917f68</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T14:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/after-neuer-who-will-be-germany-s-new-no-1-goalkeeper/a-79276377--1d35484fc587.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/after-neuer-who-will-be-germany-s-new-no-1-goalkeeper/a-79276377?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Following Manuel Neuer's retirement, there are many candidates to succeed him, but which goalkeeper will Jürgen Klopp choose? What factors will play a role? And will Neuer's future have an indirect influence?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Elversberg: Bundesliga newcomers from tiny town make waves</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9e1008e513888d9b989db3dbc70cc7058483d779cfedd92bb0f166d4c67592fe</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T06:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/elversberg-bundesliga-newcomers-from-tiny-town-make-waves/a-77194483--9d72d35ebb6f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/elversberg-bundesliga-newcomers-from-tiny-town-make-waves/a-77194483?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A team from a small southwestern German town of just 7,000 inhabitants made history by sealing promotion to become the 59th club to play in the Bundesliga. Elversberg has got off to a memorable start.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Werner Herzog: Germany's wild man of cinema is back</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c9fdb2404e0224d54167320cc5adda56cdfad936ca6f8aa9bc66f64c0cee64c7</id><updated>2026-09-18T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T16:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/werner-herzog-germany-s-wild-man-of-cinema-is-back/a-78949324--4a5372e58812.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/werner-herzog-germany-s-wild-man-of-cinema-is-back/a-78949324?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As his latest movie, "Bucking Fastard," premiered at the Venice Film Festival, DW talked to the boundary-breaking director.</summary><ca